<title>MALAYSIA: Gamuda Bhd year net up 61 pct.</title>
<headline>Gamuda Bhd year net up 61 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 55.48     vs	34.49</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	61.2	vs	39.7</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)    12.0	vs	10.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  585.74     vs     368.72</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   82.62     vs	52.03</p>
<p>    Minorities	less    0.86     vs less  0.71</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Gamuda Bhd. It is involved mainly in road building.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
